        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-501, Plain Wire Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's Simple Wire Cabinet Pull is available in five sizes: 3 inch, 3-1/2 inch, 4 inch, 6 inch, and 9 inch. The simple design makes it ideal for high-traffic areas since it is so easy to clean. Choose from either satin nickel or oil rubbed bronze finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-501 Simple Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-501</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-502</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-503</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-504</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-505</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 9-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
